# Highlights

- Pre-registered test: can a fine-tuned language model write diaries for a new country?
- Reweighted real diaries beat the model in 9 of 9 comparisons, by 1.1 to 3.9 times
- The model responds in the right direction but at about half the required strength
- Neither generated nor reweighted diaries reproduce national appliance peak hours
- For countries without survey data, reweighting neighbours' real diaries works better
